{"id":"af397ba861d72428","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dce-random-one-sided.md","title":"Random D.c.e. Reals Are One-Sided c.e.","display":"thm-dce-random-one-sided — Random D.c.e. Reals Are One-Sided c.e.","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dce-random-one-sided","aliases":["43-thm-dce-random-one-sided"],"display":"thm-dce-random-one-sided — Random D.c.e. Reals Are One-Sided c.e.","depends_on":["[[43-df-dce-real]]","[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 8.5.7 (Rettinger)","source_printed_pages":"154","source_pdf_pages":"174","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dce-random-one-sided"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dce-random-one-sided</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dce-random-one-sided — Random D.c.e. Reals Are One-Sided c.e."},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 8.5.7 (Rettinger)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"154"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"174"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]\">\\(x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{DCEReal}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightComputable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a> 并作用于序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\implies\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(x)\\lor\\mathrm{RightComputable}(x)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\implies\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(x)\\lor\\mathrm{RightComputable}(x)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有界变差近似无最终单侧性质，则它无限次从两侧穿过极限；这些有效有理区间具有有限总长度并给出 Solovay 检验，排除随机性。这是原书证明思路的说明，未在此重新构造从实区间到 Cantor 开集的全部细节。二进制值映射在 Hypothesis 内明确绑定，不把实数参数直接交给序列随机性谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 8.5.7 (Rettinger)；印刷页 154，PDF 页 174。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dce-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 并作用于序列 $X$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 并作用于序列 $X$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 并作用于序列 $X$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RightComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\implies\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(x)\\lor\\mathrm{RightComputable}(x)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1764,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dce-random-one-sided]] — Random D.c.e. Reals Are One-Sided c.e."}],"outgoing":["2485b90ec527f97e","cee54b08acdf9958","0586e0fd0301d605"]}